<title>USA: Reading &amp; Bates to take $20.6 mln Q3 charge.</title>
<headline>Reading &amp; Bates to take $20.6 mln Q3 charge.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reading &amp; Bates Corp said Wednesday its Reading &amp; Bates Development Co subsidiary participated in three unsuccessful exploratory wells in the Gulf of Mexico completed in July, and as a result the company will take an about $20.6 million nonrecurring charge in the third quarter.</p>
<p>The company said its working interest in the wells ranged from 25 percent to 50 percent, which under the successful efforts accounting method must be written off against earnings for the third quarter of 1997.</p>
